ts in a world of clean  energy in our foundation we are making  investments and we are looking at a  financial return but we also are looking  make an impact the impact that we like  to make is really being a catalyst so  the way we would measure the impact  would be if we made an investment did  other people make an investment  afterwards did we actually test out a  innovative business model was there a  gap in the in the investment  infrastructure of some sort that we  plugged the gap with our small  investment and as a result of that we  proved that a model and other people  came behind us and made a similar  investment that's the way we measure it  if we were successful other people are  coming into the market larger dollars  are coming into the market and  eventually the risks that might have  been associated with the investment we  made will have gone down because  everybody will have proved out the risks  and once the risks go down there's a lot  of capital that can come into the market  people want to come in there just they  have a different risk profile than a  small family foundation
 

